# Everything the build stages produce themselves. Leaving these out keeps the build
# context small and, more importantly, stops a stale local bin/ or node_modules/ from
# leaking into the image and masking a broken build.
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/.angular/

.git/
.github/
.vs/
.vscode/
.idea/

**/*.db
**/*.db-shm
**/*.db-wal

tests/
docs/
README.md
LICENSE

**/appsettings.Development.json
**/appsettings.*.Local.json
.env
.env.*
